---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import { EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_STUDY as study } from '../../data/effectiveStateGdrLoraStudy';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const boundedHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/bounded-effective-state-gdr/');
const directHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/q17-directapply-analysis/#final');
---

<section id="latest-1p7b" class="same-panel" aria-labelledby="latest-1p7b-title">
  <div class="same-panel__intro">
    <p class="same-panel__eyebrow">{t('最新封存 · 1.7B', 'Latest sealed · 1.7B')}</p>
    <h2 id="latest-1p7b-title">{t('三种最终状态，做同一份 128 题', 'Three final states on the same 128 tasks')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      'DirectApply、Bounded OFF 和 Bounded + Effective-State GDR ON 最后都用了完全相同的冻结题集。因此这三个 Final 可以直接并排看；但 DirectApply 是更早的独立实验，不是 OFF / ON 预注册对照的第三条 arm。',
      'DirectApply, Bounded OFF, and Bounded + Effective-State GDR ON all used exactly the same frozen final panel. Their final scores can therefore be shown side by side, but DirectApply is an earlier independent experiment rather than a third arm of the preregistered OFF/ON contrast.',
    )}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="same-panel__cards" aria-label={t('三个 1.7B 同题 Final', 'Three 1.7B same-panel finals')}>
    <article>
      <span>DirectApply</span>
      <strong>{study.threeWayFinal.directApply.score.toFixed(2)}</strong>
      <span class="same-panel__exact">{study.threeWayFinal.directApply.exactCount}/128 exact</span>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>Bounded OFF</span>
      <strong>{study.threeWayFinal.off.score.toFixed(2)}</strong>
      <span class="same-panel__exact">{study.threeWayFinal.off.exactCount}/128 exact</span>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>Bounded + GDR ON</span>
      <strong>{study.threeWayFinal.on.score.toFixed(2)}</strong>
      <span class="same-panel__exact">{study.threeWayFinal.on.exactCount}/128 exact</span>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="same-panel__reading">
    <strong>{t('训练过程和最终考试给出的信号不一样。', 'Training trajectory and final exam give different signals.')}</strong>
    <p>{t(
      '在 R1–R159 的训练期平均里，ON 的 reward 比 OFF 高约 0.025，但 95% 区间跨过 0，完整成功率反而低约 2.21 个百分点；到了冻结 Final，OFF 为 45.98，ON 为 20.77。两种测量回答不同问题，所以这里同时保留。',
      'Across R1–R159, ON mean reward is about 0.025 above OFF, but the 95% interval crosses zero and exact success is about 2.21 percentage points lower. On the frozen final, OFF scores 45.98 and ON 20.77. These measurements answer different questions, so both are retained.',
    )}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="same-panel__actions">
    <a href={boundedHref}>{t('看完整 OFF / ON、计算时间与参数分析 →', 'Open full OFF/ON, compute, and parameter analysis →')}</a>
    <a href={directHref}>{t('看 DirectApply 独立实验 →', 'Open the DirectApply experiment →')}</a>
  </div>

  <details class="same-panel__evidence">
    <summary>{t('展开实验依据', 'Open experiment evidence')}</summary>
    <p>{t(
      '三次终评的 panel content SHA、panel file SHA 与 selected-panel digest 完全一致。OFF / ON 的长期分析按预注册 moving-block bootstrap 计算；分类为 LONG_HORIZON_TRANSIENT_ONLY。',
      'All three finals share identical panel-content SHA, panel-file SHA, and selected-panel digest. The OFF/ON long-horizon analysis uses the preregistered moving-block bootstrap and is classified LONG_HORIZON_TRANSIENT_ONLY.',
    )}</p>
    <a href={study.evidence.publicSnapshot}>{t('公开机器可读快照', 'Public machine-readable snapshot')}</a>
  </details>
</section>
<style>
  .same-panel{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:42px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .same-panel__intro{max-width:820px}.same-panel__eyebrow{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.76rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .same-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.7rem);letter-spacing:-.04em}.same-panel__intro>p:last-child{max-width:76ch;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .same-panel__cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:22px}
  .same-panel__cards article{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .same-panel__cards span{display:block;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.same-panel__exact{font-size:1rem}.same-panel__cards strong{display:block;margin:8px 0 2px;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);letter-spacing:-.05em}
  .same-panel__reading{max-width:880px;margin-top:20px;padding:16px 18px;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);background:var(--color-surface-subtle)}
  .same-panel__reading p{margin:6px 0 0;line-height:1.68;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .same-panel__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 20px;margin-top:18px}.same-panel__actions a,.same-panel__evidence a{color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:760;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .same-panel__evidence{max-width:880px;margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-top:10px}.same-panel__evidence summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:740}.same-panel__evidence p{max-width:78ch;line-height:1.65;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  @media(max-width:720px){.same-panel{padding:34px 18px}.same-panel__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.same-panel__cards article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end}.same-panel__exact{grid-column:1/-1}}
</style>
